<title>USA: UNUM sets 2-for-1 stk split, dividend boost.</title>
<headline>UNUM sets 2-for-1 stk split, dividend boost.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Me. 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>UNUM Corp said Friday it has declared a two-for-one stock split and will increase its the next regularly scheduled cash dividend to $0.285 from $0.275 per share on a pre-split basis.</p>
<p>The split, subject to shareholder approval, will be payable June 2 to shareholders of record, May 19.</p>
<p>The cash dividend will be payable May 16 to shareholders of record April 28.</p>
<p>UNUM Corporation is a disability and special risk insurance holding company.</p>
